window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Coyote shifter Mercy Thompson and Alpha werewolf Adam finally reach the altar. But when they make the Columbia River their honeymoon destination, their newlywed bliss turns into a fight for survival....</p> <p>Being a different breed of shapeshifter—a walker—Mercy can see ghosts, but the spirit of her long-gone father has never visited her. Until now. An evil is stirring in the depths of the Columbia River—and innocent people are dying. As other walkers make their presence known to Mercy, she must reconnect with her heritage to exorcise the world of the legend known as the river devil.</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects, and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Khaya Fraites, Gregory Linington, Joey Sourlis, Ryan Dalusung, James Lewis, Richard Rohan, NJ Agwuna, Rayner Gabriel, Christopher Walker, Renee Dorian, Erin Lin, Sheree Wichard, Jon Vertullo, Jessica Threet, Laura C. Harris, Bianca Bryan, Karenna Foley, Maria Amelia Park, Nanette Savard, Rose Elizabeth Supan, Mort Shelby, Marni Penning, Scott McCormick, Steven Carpenter, Mike Carnes, Adrian Garcia, Michael John Casey, Damon Alums, Kay Elúvian, Nhea Durousseau, RJ Bayley, Sandi Stock, Terence Aselford, George Kopas, Christopher McLinden, Yasmin Tuazon, Eric Messner, Bradley Foster Smith, Drew Kopas, and Michael Glenn.</p>"; 
